---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /
description: "Traddyland is Lou Massett's memoir of growing up inside the Society of St. Pius X, its boarding school in St. Marys, Kansas, and what it took to leave. Featured in Newsweek, the National Catholic Reporter, and UnHerd."
---
<section class="hero on-dark">
  <img class="bg" src="/images/video-cost.jpg" alt="" width="1280" height="720" fetchpriority="high">
  <video class="bg" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="/images/video-cost.jpg" aria-hidden="true"><source src="/video/what-does-it-cost.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">{{ home.hero.kicker }}</p>
      <h1>{{ home.hero.headline }}</h1>
      <p class="lede">{{ home.hero.lede }}</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn" href="{{ site.amazon }}">{{ home.hero.primary }}</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="/book/#excerpt">{{ home.hero.secondary }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a href="/book/"><img class="cover" src="/images/cover.jpg" alt="Traddyland: The Memoir of a Radical Traditional Catholic, by Louis Massett" width="982" height="1476"></a>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "press-strip.njk" %}

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap two-col top">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>{{ home.why.heading }}</h2>
      {{ home.why.body | md | dropcap | safe }}
      <a class="textlink" href="/book/">About the book →</a>
    </div>
    <figure style="margin:0">
      <img src="/images/st-marys-campus.jpg" alt="The former Jesuit campus at St. Marys, Kansas, now the SSPX's flagship school" width="2856" height="1607" loading="lazy">
      <figcaption class="caption">{{ home.why.caption }}</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band paper-2">
  <div class="wrap">
    {%- for q in praise %}{% if q.featured %}
    <blockquote class="featured-quote">{{ q.quote }}<cite>{{ q.who }}</cite></blockquote>
    {% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band dusk on-dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>{{ home.acts.heading }}</h2>
    <div class="movements">
      {%- for a in home.acts.items %}<div><p class="num">{{ a.num }}</p><h3>{{ a.title }}</h3><p>{{ a.text }}</p></div>{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band white">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head"><h2>What readers are saying</h2><a class="textlink" href="/press/">Press and reviews →</a></div>
    <div class="praise">
    {%- for q in praise %}{% if not q.featured %}
      <blockquote>{{ q.quote }}<cite>{{ q.who }}</cite></blockquote>
    {% endif %}{%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <img class="portrait" src="/images/lou-massett.jpg" alt="Lou Massett" width="724" height="1086" loading="lazy" style="max-width:420px">
    <div>
      <h2>A writer working from inside the world he is trying to understand.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Lou Massett was raised in the Society of St. Pius X and spent five years at its boarding school in Kansas. He left the movement in his early twenties and has watched it from the outside for thirty years. <em>Traddyland</em> is his first book.</p>
      <p>In July 2026 Newsweek quoted him on the human cost of the excommunications. His essay on St. Marys ran in UnHerd the same month.</p>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="/about/">Read the full biography</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band dusk on-dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head"><h2>A first look at the book</h2></div>
    <video class="feature" controls preload="none" poster="/images/video-first-look.jpg" width="1920" height="1080"><source src="/video/first-look.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <p class="caption">A short introduction to the story, the family behind it, and the questions it asks.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band white">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div>
      <h2>Are You Serious? A podcast on faith, culture, and radical ideas.</h2>
      <p class="lede">The Traddyland podcast extends the book into conversation, about faith, family, ideology, and the long road out of certainty. Hosted by Lou Massett. First episodes coming this fall.</p>
      <a class="textlink" href="/podcast/">About the podcast →</a>
    </div>
    <img src="/images/podcast-are-you-serious.jpg" alt="Are You Serious? podcast artwork" width="1024" height="1024" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;max-width:380px;justify-self:center">
  </div>
</section>

